* 210_indirect_ref.sno — indirect variable reference via $ operator
* Rung 2. 2 assertions.

        bal = 'the real bal'

*       $'name' looks up variable named by string
        DIFFER($'bal', bal)                   :f(e001)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 210/001: $string lookup'        :(END)
e001

*       $.var looks up variable whose name is in var
        DIFFER($.bal, bal)                   :f(e002)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 210/002: $.var lookup'          :(END)
e002

        OUTPUT = 'PASS 210_indirect_ref (2/2)'
END
